hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1454","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Shayar ne sab se sachi baat kahi, Labid ka kalima: Suno! Allah ke siwa har cheez batil hai. Aur Umayya bin Abi al-Salt musalman hone ke qareeb tha."
"1455","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ka pet peep se bhar jaye jo use kharab kare, us se behtar hai ke wo sher se bhar jaye."
